NOT MEDICAL ADVICE, AND NOT REAL DATA.

This project is a hackathon prototype. Every patient, document, laboratory
result and medication in it is synthetic, generated by tools/generate_data.py.
The drug names CardioZen, Renuvex and Hepatrol are invented so that no real
medicine is named and no real safety guidance is misquoted.

Nothing here is clinical guidance and nothing here may be used to make a
decision about a real person's care.
